{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In his third adventure, Nelson is asked for help by the undertaker. He accidentally discovers an ancient secret, which sends him and his friends on an adventurous journey. Nelson not only has to solve dangerous tasks, but also faces his most evil adversary: \u200b\u200bCaptain Coleslaw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111130/extras/9af061c28a1c92641ba420598460ef21.avif?t=1761763052\" width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So it could be that there are a few pirates in this game too. Of course, they're not clich\u00e9d pirates with sabres or anything like that. But maybe they are. Who can remember everything about the content of a game? You'd have to be the game developer to do that. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait a minute... I am the developer. Oh man, how can I not remember that clearly? Well, maybe I'm just too old to be developing games. Who knows for sure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111130/extras/5ab45ee12a172d940d0cc78c3711988f.poster.avif?t=1761763052\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111130/extras/5ab45ee12a172d940d0cc78c3711988f.webm?t=1761763052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111130/extras/5ab45ee12a172d940d0cc78c3711988f.mp4?t=1761763052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features many humorous dialogues with wacky characters who can be found in the most unusual places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic point-and-click adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn comic graphics (no 3D frills)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four chapters full of bizarre situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many wacky characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black humor</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4111130?t=1761763052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111130/d82859d0bbcf4e51795431a130aa0c3439c74f9a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761763052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111130/62061b7c65a320d5e4dda6031cbb74fbf1e53ca5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761763052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111130/62061b7c65a320d5e4dda6031cbb74fbf1e53ca5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761763052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In his third adventure, Nelson is asked for help by the undertaker. He accidentally discovers an ancient secret, which sends him and his friends on an adventurous journey. Nelson not only has to solve dangerous tasks, but also faces his most evil adversary: \u200b\u200bCaptain Coleslaw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph